    "abilities": [
        {
            "id": "000008481",
            "name": "Close-range Eradication",
            "description": "Ranged weapons equipped by <span class=\"kwb\">ADEPTUS</span> <span class=\"kwb\">ASTARTES</span> models from your army have the [ASSAULT] ability, and each time an attack made with such a weapon targets a unit within 12\", add 1 to the Strength characteristic of that attack.",
            "legend": "The Space Marines are the Emperor’s finest shock troops, striking at the foe before they can react. In their rapid, mechanised assaults, Space Marines smash aside the enemy, destroying them at close quarters without mercy.",
